# Force LF line endings on checkout so cross-platform CI (e.g. the Windows
# release runner, which defaults to core.autocrlf=true) reads source files with
# the same newlines as macOS/Linux. Tests that assert on exact CSS/TS source
# contents (src/ui/__tests__/markdown.test.ts) otherwise fail on CRLF checkouts.
* text=auto eol=lf
